from other clouds.

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:05.290
Firstly, security
is at its core.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.600
Google infrastructure
was born in the cloud

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:11.120
and built from the ground
up with security in mind.

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:14.710
Secondly, our fully managed
serverless offerings

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:16.990
eliminate that
operational complexity

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:20.630
that is required when
moving to cloud, and making

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:22.460
cloud easy to adopt.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:24.860
And thirdly, openness
is in Google's DNA.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:27.860
From our commitment to open
source software in areas

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:30.380
like TensorFlow and Kubernetes
to the way in which we build

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:33.380
our products to give
you flexibility,

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.880
our open approach
means that you can

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:41.630
develop applications that are
easy to run and fast to deploy.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:44.038
And finally, we're bringing
you the best of Google

00:11:44.038 --> 00:11:45.080
for your marketing needs.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:48.860
Google is inherently
deeply entrenched

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:51.200
in the marketing space through
all the work that's done

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.965
on the ad side of our business.

00:11:52.965 --> 00:11:55.220
And we have integrations
with other Google products,

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:58.670
like the Google Marketing
Platform, Google Ads, Maps,

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:03.050
Play, and YouTube, that help
you get more from these products

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:05.102
