00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:45.790
is on mobile, or
has just transacted,

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:49.140
we identify that immediately,
not two or three days later,

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:51.400
and we can react to them.

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:56.280
So by identifying those
three main capabilities that

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:57.852
were needed and for
our vision, we're

00:19:57.852 --> 00:19:59.310
