00:30:14.192 --> 00:30:16.150
And I'm going to talk a
little bit about what's

00:30:16.150 --> 00:30:17.320
it like to be your customer.

00:30:17.320 --> 00:30:20.590
You saw when the Google
Marketing Platform focuses

00:30:20.590 --> 00:30:23.680
around customer journey and
understanding that journey

00:30:23.680 --> 00:30:25.360
with your customer.

00:30:25.360 --> 00:30:28.403
And we've spent a lot of work
partnering with our CX and UX

00:30:28.403 --> 00:30:30.820
team to actually build out a
really comprehensive customer

00:30:30.820 --> 00:30:32.080
journey that I'm going to
talk a little bit about.

00:30:32.080 --> 00:30:33.788
And then I'm going to
talk about the work

00:30:33.788 --> 00:30:37.000
that my team is doing to measure
and understand that for each

00:30:37.000 --> 00:30:39.630
and every customer, every time.

00:30:39.630 --> 00:30:40.130
OK.

00:30:40.130 --> 00:30:41.410
So first, American
Eagle Outfitters,

00:30:41.410 --> 00:30:44.230
if you don't know who we are, we
really are two primary brands--

00:30:44.230 --> 00:30:48.160
American Eagle brand, maker of
the best jeans in the world.

00:30:48.160 --> 00:30:50.810
By the way, the number one
